        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 1996 AT&T Challenge\n- Places: Johns Creek, Georgia; Fulton County; Georgia; United States\n- Organizations: Atlanta Athletic Club; ATP Tour; USA TODAY\n- Concepts: World Series\n\nFacts:\n- The 1996 AT&T Challenge was a tennis tournament played on outdoor clay courts at the Atlanta Athletic Club in Johns Creek, Georgia, in the United States.\n- The 1996 AT&T Challenge was part of the World Series of the 1996 ATP Tour.\n- Johns Creek is a city in Fulton County in the U.S. state of Georgia.\n- In 2017, Johns Creek ranked third on USA TODAY's list of the \"50 best cities to live in.\"",
